  "description": "Expand your RYOBI 18V ONE+ system with the RYOBI 18V ONE+ Dual Temperature Glue Gun. This glue gun is the perfect addition to your ONE+ collection. The included interchangeable tips keep you prepared for any project that comes your way. Dual temperature settings offer greater versatility, allowing you to heat up to 120°F at low temperature for heat-sensitive materials, or heat up to 160°F high for adhesives such as building glue. This tool is compatible with all 1/2 inches. Full size glue sticks and 3 are included so you can get a jump start on your current project. The collapsible drip tray will ensure you always have a clean workspace. The on-board LED light will change colour to let you know when the instrument is ready to use after a quick two-minute warm-up time. Best of all, it's part of the RYOBI ONE+ system of over 225 cordless tools that all work on the same battery platform. This tool is backed by the RYOBI 3 year manufacturer's warranty and includes the 18V dual temperature glue gun with standard nozzle. Battery and charger sold separately.",
